---
description: Prefer Plan for large phases; Ask for read-only; Debug for bugs; Agent to implement
alwaysApply: true
---

# Cursor modes (UX Flow)

| Situation | Mode |
| --------- | ---- |
| Multi-file phase / architecture trade-offs | **Plan** first, then Agent |
| Question only / explain code | **Ask** (no edits) |
| Reproduce / root-cause bug | **Debug** when available |
| Approved implementation | **Agent** |

Slash helpers: `/plan-phase`, `/ask`, `/debug`. Do not start a huge phase in Agent without a short plan announcement.
